      "content": "i dont even know why im typing this. everything i thought was real... everything i built my whole life on... it's just gone. i feel like there's no ground under me anymore. just this massive emptiness where my soul used to be. like i'm just a ghost drifting through a world that doesn't even make sense. what's even the point of trying to rebuild when the foundation was a lie?",
